1
00:00:00,684 --> 00:00:03,814
(Leonard:)Easy-peasy, ooh, so breezy.

2
00:00:16,971 --> 00:00:17,971
(Stuart:)Hey, what's up?

3
00:00:18,039 --> 00:00:19,439
(Raj:)I'm here to put
the crib together.

4
00:00:19,441 --> 00:00:21,271
(Stuart:)Ooh, sorry, I already did it.

5
00:00:21,276 --> 00:00:25,116
Oh, I don't know if you realize
this, but I bought that crib.

6
00:00:25,113 --> 00:00:29,513
(Stuart:)Oh, yeah, I read about that
on WhoGivesACrap.com

7
00:00:31,319 --> 00:00:32,719
(Raj:)Why are you being like this?

8
00:00:33,788 --> 00:00:35,658
(Stuart:)Because I love
Howard and Bernadette

9
00:00:35,657 --> 00:00:39,057
(Stuart:)and if I want to keep mooching
off them, I need to be helpful.

10
00:00:39,928 --> 00:00:40,998
(Raj:)Hey, this pregnancy had

11
00:00:40,995 --> 00:00:42,025
(Raj:)an emotionally-needy third wheel

12
00:00:42,030 --> 00:00:44,160
(Raj:)way before you came along.

13
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:47,500
(Stuart:)Why can't there be four wheels?

14
00:00:47,502 --> 00:00:50,072
(Raj:)Is this what you do
when I'm not here,

15
00:00:50,071 --> 00:00:52,301
(Raj:)make really good points?

16
00:00:52,307 --> 00:00:56,107
Look-Look, just come in and
help me build a baby swing.

